---
// Card art: two-circle flow after a neutral pass, close up. Plan view.
// Same geometry and turn directions as the module's flow figure
// (bfm/FlowFigure): two turn circles, both aircraft turning clockwise.
const jet = 'M0 -11 L2 -5 L2 -2 L9 3 L9 5 L2 3 L2 7 L4 10 L4 11 L0 10 L-4 11 L-4 10 L-2 7 L-2 3 L-9 5 L-9 3 L-2 -2 L-2 -5 Z';
